WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.240
What we are witnessing here

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.660
is the return of titans.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.900
How many these things are there?

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.240
17. And counting.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.600
That's messed up.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.220
Mothra.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.900
Rodan.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.400
Ghidorah.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.520
Oh my.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.840
They're moving like a pack.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.120
They're hunting.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.020
They all respond directly

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:44.780
to an Alpha.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.480
We stop this Ghidorah

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.840
we stop them all.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.040
Is there another creature that might stand a chance against him?

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:02.860
My god

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:03.760
zilla.

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:11.140
Our planet will perish

00:01:13.649 --> 00:01:15.649
and so will we

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.560
unless we set Godzilla free.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.380
Oh, yeah sure, let's bring him in for a beer.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.020
No. This time we join the fight.

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.240
Run.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.640
This is Godzilla's world.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.380
We just live in it.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:04.600
Damn right.

